- Creates a constant variable initialized to `constValue`
- Creates a reactive calculation that automatically computes the sum of both variables
- Gets the initial sum value
- Updates the mutable variable by adding `delta` to the base value
- Gets the updated sum (which automatically reflects the change in the mutable variable)
- Returns both sums in a `ConstVarResult` struct

The constant variable cannot be modified (as shown in the comment in the test), so only changes to the mutable variable will trigger recalculation.

